#. Translators: What's new for this version, shown in the add-on store.
#. Markdown: NVDA renders it and reads it line by line.
#: manifest.ini:changelog
msgid ""
"- NVDA no longer crashes when the device menu is closed after a device was switched from the favourites tab.\n"
"- Enter or Space on a VeSync or Cozytouch device no longer freezes NVDA.\n"
"- A leak sensor that already detects water when NVDA starts is now announced.\n"
"- The Netatmo device menu offers \"Add to favorites\" again.\n"
"- A setting changed in the VeSync or Cozytouch device menu is no longer also recorded as changed elsewhere.\n"
"- A Meross device switched here is no longer taken for one switched elsewhere.\n"
"- A Cozytouch command the appliance takes over late is announced as sent and confirmed once it arrives, instead of being reported as failed.\n"
"- A Cozytouch boost that runs out after an NVDA restart is recorded as ended.\n"
"- The Cozytouch away period is shown in the date format of the region.\n"
"- A Meross account with two-factor authentication is named as the reason the sign-in fails, and such a sign-in is no longer retried for good.\n"
"- Testing the Netatmo connection no longer invalidates the running sign-in.\n"
"- A foreign call of the Netatmo callback address no longer ends the sign-in.\n"
"- A Cozytouch server fault at sign-in is retried.\n"
"- Renewed tokens no longer write NVDA's whole configuration to disk.\n"
"- NVDA exits faster on a slow network.\n"
"- Meross garage door openers and roller shutters are shown but not switched."
msgstr ""

